@title 3D view: ducts are drawn slotted, zoomed to one duct, and the Layers toggle makes them solid
@area 3D
@sizes 1920x1080
# Fixed 1366x768 window point: a horizontal duct of the example is at (1050,440) in the default 3D view. F zooms to the selected duct so the fingers show.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
shot ducts-default
click 1050 440
wait 40
key f
wait 300
shot duct-zoomed
click_text Layers
wait 20
expect "Slotted ducts"
shot layers-menu
click_text "Slotted ducts"
wait 40
shot duct-solid
click_text "Slotted ducts"
wait 40
shot duct-slotted-again
check_layout
